# Built by `npm run seed` from warehouse/data/*.parquet. The database is a build
# output: it is rewritten on every seed and is ~9x the size of the same data in
# Parquet, so the Parquet is what ships and this is not committed.
warehouse/*.duckdb
warehouse/*.duckdb.wal
